  {
    "insert": "\nThis exposé explores the application of AI assistants in private tutoring, specifically focusing on augmented reality (AR) scenarios. It aims to evaluate the learning experience provided by AI tutors in comparison to traditional private tutors, addressing the impact on educational outcomes.\n"
